        "q": "What is included in a standard shelter pet adoption fee?",
        "a": "Adoption fees ($50–$350) typically include mandatory spay/neuter surgery, complete core vaccines, microchipping, deworming, and heartworm/FIV/FeLV testing (saving $600–$900 in retail vet costs)."
